url: "https://github.com/knowlet/Decision-Theoretic-Mixture-of-Agents/releases/tag/v1.4.0"
abstract: "AI-assisted decision-theoretic study with finite simulation, historical LLM response replay, ProEval population replacement, and actual OpenJev CPU selector inference on a 128-question pilot. Calibration, cost, order and numerical limitations are reported; no proprietary Jev inference, CERA agent training or universal architectural optimality is claimed."
